%3Erow.sourceCommit%3D%3D%3Drevision%29%2Cfalse%2C%27a%20committed%20epoch%20is%20appended%20once%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20review%3DOVERLAY_PROVIDER_APPEND_REVIEW%2Clast%3Doriginal.profiles.at%28-1%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28last.sourceCommit%2Creview.previous%2C%27this%20review%20applies%20to%20the%20exact%20preceding%20provider%20profile%27%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20capture%3Dfile%3D%3E%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%7Bblob%2Ccertificate%7D%3DcaptureGitArtifactCertificate%28revision%2Cfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28Buffer.from%28blob.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%29.equals%28blob%29%2Ctrue%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20verifyGitArtifactCertificate%28certificate%2Cblob%2C%7Brevision%2Cpath%3Afile%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20assert.equal%28readFileSync%28new%20URL%28file%2Croot%29%29.equals%28blob%29%2Ctrue%2C%27every%20captured%20actual%20file%20belongs%20to%20the%20real%20epoch%3A%20%27%2Bfile%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20return%7Brevision%2Cfile%2C...pin%28blob%29%2Csource%3Ablob.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%2Ccertificate%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20preceding%3Dcapture%28output%29%3Bassert.equal%28preceding.source%2CpreviousBytes.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20priorOutputs%3Doutputs%28original%29.map%28row%3D%3E%7Bconst%20actual%3Dcapture%28row.file%29%3Bassert.equal%28actual.source%2Crow.source%29%3Breturn%20actual%3B%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20const%20providers%3D%5B%5D%2Ccertificates%3D%5B%5D%2Cinverse%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20for%28const%20module%20of%20modules%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20const%20current%3Dcapture%28%27js%2Fsrc%2F%27%2Bmodule%29%2Cprevious%3Dlast.certificates.find%28row%3D%3Erow.module%3D%3D%3Dmodule%29.current%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20providers.push%28%7Bmodule%2CsourceSha256%3Acurrent.sha256%7D%29%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20certificates.push%28%7Bmodule%2Cprevious%3AstructuredClone%28previous%29%2Ccurrent%3A%7Brevision%2Csource%3Acurrent.source%2Ccertificate%3Acurrent.certificate%7D%7D%29%3B%0A%